# Hosted-agent secrets are managed in the Agentverse dashboard (Hosted Agents -> Secrets), never in files.
# ASI1_API_KEY and ASI1_BASE_URL are injected by Agentverse automatically - no key is needed.
# Optional: set PDF_UPLOAD_URL to your own upload endpoint (multipart POST with a "file"
# field that returns a URL). If unset, PDFs go to the default public host https://file.io.
